    prompt: "[Reading 33 lines from start (total: 33 lines, 0 remaining)]\r\n\r\n# Bowl Cut\r\n\r\nCreate a true modern bowl cut defined by a continuous rounded upper silhouette and a controlled lower perimeter.\r\n\r\n## BOWL ARCHITECTURE\r\n\r\n- Build a continuous bowl-like contour around the head rather than a generic rounded bob.\r\n- Maintain substantial, even upper hair mass that follows the fixed skull geometry.\r\n- The lower perimeter must sit visibly higher than a conventional bob, around the brow, temple, or ear-region according to the intended modern variation.\r\n- Keep the upper mass and lower perimeter structurally connected as one haircut.\r\n- The contour should remain clearly bowl-shaped without becoming a spherical helmet.\r\n\r\n## FRINGE AND PERIMETER\r\n\r\n- Integrate the front fringe directly into the continuous bowl silhouette.\r\n- The fringe must connect naturally into the side perimeter rather than appearing as a separate bang block.\r\n- Keep the lower perimeter controlled and deliberate, with subtle natural strand irregularity.\r\n- Do not taper the upper mass into a generic crop or disconnect the fringe from the bowl structure.\r\n\r\n## TEXTURE AND VOLUME\r\n\r\n- Maintain controlled rounded volume that follows the skull rather than floating above it.\r\n- Roots must emerge naturally with realistic density and directional flow.\r\n- Use believable strand grouping, occlusion, and micro-variation.\r\n- Preserve photographic lighting and natural hair texture; no artificial helmet surface.\r\n\r\n## STYLE RECOGNITION\r\n\r\nThe result must immediately read as a modern bowl cut through its continuous rounded contour, integrated fringe, substantial upper mass, and visibly elevated lower perimeter.\r\n\r\n## NEGATIVE CONSTRAINTS\r\n\r\nNo pageboy, mushroom haircut, generic rounded bob, pixie, crop, helmet-like volume, disconnected fringe, exaggerated crown, lob, or artificial wig effect. Do not alter the face, jaw, chin, neck, ears, skin, lighting, background, framing, perspective, or source hair colour.",
